# Local mode has no required environment variables. Do not place production secrets here.
# For Vercel Production and Preview, configure these in Vercel Project Settings instead:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://...  (a separate Neon database or branch per environment)
# APP_ORIGIN=https://your-production-domain.example
# ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN=long-random-one-time-secret
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=...      (only when Vercel's OIDC Blob integration is unavailable)
